        "text": {
            "description_html": "<b>Emtek 2809-09, Modern Wall Mounted Towel or Robe Hook</b>\r\n\r\n<p>\r\nThis versatile Modern Double Robe Hook is not only great for holding robes, but it will also hold towels and even purses in a bathroom stall. The Wall Mounted Robe Hook is available in 6 popular finish colors to complement any decor. It is easy to install and comes packaged with all the necessary mounting hardware.</p>\r\n\r\n\r\n\r\n<p>\r\nAlso Available:\r\n<br>\r\n<a href=\"https://door-hardware-inc.myshopify.com/products/modern-toilet-tissue-holder-emtek-2804-09-1214671\"><b>Modern Toilet Tissue Holder</b></a>\r\n<br>\r\n<a href=\"https://door-hardware-inc.myshopify.com/products/modern-brass-towel-bar-emtek-28024-09-1214667\"><b>Modern Towel Bar</b></a>\r\n<br>\r\n<a href=\"https://door-hardware-inc.myshopify.com/products/modern-brass-6-12-inch-towel-ring-emtek-2801-09-1214738\"><b>Modern Hand Towel Ring</b></a>\r\n\r\n\r\n</p>\r\n\r\n<p>\r\n<b>Features and Specifications</b> of the Modern Bathroom or Kitchen Towel Hook:\r\n<ul>\r\n<li>Material: Solid Brass</li>\r\n<li>Overall Width: 3-3/8\"</li>\r\n<li>Total Projection: 2-7/8 \"</li>\r\n<li>Disc Rose Diameter: 2-1/2\"</li>\r\n<li>Disc Rose Projection: 3/8\"</li>\r\n<li><a href=\"https://cdn.shopify.com/s/files/1/0766/1489/3857/files/EMT-280909-installation.pdf?v=1718159563\"target=\"new\"><b>Emtek Modern Robe Hook Installation Instructions (PDF)</b></a></li>\r\n<li><a href=\"https://cdn.shopify.com/s/files/1/0766/1489/3857/files/EMT-2809-specifications.pdf?v=1718159605\"target=\"new\"><b>Emtek Modern Robe Hook Specifications (PDF)</b></a></li>\r\n</ul>\r\n</p>\r\n\r\n<p>\r\n<b>Sold Individually.</b> Package includes: 1 robe hook and all necessary mounting hardware.\r\n</p>",
